{"id":"2369646683950d58","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-mred-trans.md","title":"多一归约的复合","display":"thm-mred-trans — 多一归约的复合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-mred-trans","aliases":["20-thm-mred-trans"],"display":"thm-mred-trans — 多一归约的复合","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.8 后的自反与传递性","source_pdf_pages":[50],"source_printed_pages":[14],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-mred-trans"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-mred-trans</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mred-trans — 多一归约的复合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.8 后的自反与传递性"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_mB\">\\(A\\le_mB\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_mC\">\\(B\\le_mC\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mred\\text{-}trans}\\vdash\nA\\le_mC.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mred\\text{-}trans}\\vdash\nA\\le_mC.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取全可计算见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span>，其复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\circ f\">\\(g\\circ f\\)</span> 全可计算，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\\iff f(x)\\in B\\iff g(f(x))\\in C\">\\(x\\in A\\iff f(x)\\in B\\iff g(f(x))\\in C\\)</span>。恒等函数还给出自反性。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.8 后的自反与传递性；印刷页 14；PDF 第 50 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_mB","display":false},{"tex":"B\\le_mC","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mred\\text{-}trans}\\vdash\nA\\le_mC.","display":true},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"g\\circ f","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A\\iff f(x)\\in B\\iff g(f(x))\\in C","display":false}],"bytes":932,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-mred-trans]] — 章 1；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-mred-trans]]"}],"outgoing":["d5dada982b721c80"]}